OL,3,GNEWSAHeroin seized as nine arrested in
OL,4,Adrug raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeroin and cannabis have been seized in
OL,7,Fearly morning raids targeting suspected
OL,8,Fdrug dealers in Birmingham and Walsall.
OL,10,FNine people were arrested during
OL,11,FTuesday's operation, which followed a
OL,12,Fsix-month investigation into suspected
OL,13,Fdrug supply in the Soho Road area.
OL,15,FBBC News was given access to go along
OL,16,Fwith 70 officers as they carried out
OL,17,Fraids across Handsworth, Selly Oak,
OL,18,FBirmingham city centre and Walsall.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
