OL,3,GNEWSAHeroin seized as nine arrested in
OL,4,Adrug raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspects, aged between 21 and 60,
OL,7,Fremained in custody on suspicion of
OL,8,Fbeing concerned in the supply of Class
OL,9,FA drugs, police said.
